# The HUDs' words (PlatformerHudDesc, ShooterHudDesc, PuzzleHudDesc, IdleHudDesc, RacingHudDesc: og-i18n §2) and their screens' names.
string "hud.pause" "Pause"
string "hud.jump" "Jump"
string "hud.fire" "Fire"
string "hud.kills" "kills"
string "hud.weapon" "Carbine"
